{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-09-24T20:07:17.013Z","data":{"text":"Done.\n\n**Changed**\n- `src/core/run/manifest.ts` — `ManifestData` now has optional `approvedAt` and `createdAtSource?: 'created'`. Removed `resolveCreatedAt` and its `resolveChangeDoc` import, replacing it with `resolveCreation`, which:\n  - keeps an existing valid `.run/manifest.json` `createdAt` (with its `created` marker when present; never adds one to an unmarked value),\n  - else uses the change folder's valid non-epoch birth time marked `created`,\n  - else the current time, marked `created` only when no approval flags were passed.\n  `approvedAt` is written only on the approval path, so `writeBriefAndManifest` emits none.\n- `tests/manifest-creation.test.ts` — new tests: plan-time manifest marked with no `approvedAt`; approval/reapproval keep the plan-time `createdAt`/marker with non-decreasing `approvedAt`; an existing unmarked `createdAt` is kept without a marker; no-manifest approval records the marked folder birth time (skipped only on a zero birth time).\n\n**Verification**\n- `node --import tsx --test tests/manifest-creation.test.ts` → 4 pass\n- `pnpm verify` → exit 0\n\nTouched: src/core/run/manifest.ts, tests/manifest-creation.test.ts"}}
